  <!-- ============ WORDMARK RATIONALE ============ -->
  <div class="vc-section">
    <div class="vc-eyebrow">01 — Wordmark</div>
    <div class="vc-h1">A cut, not a curve</div>
    <div class="vc-sub">Lowercase geometric grotesque, custom-modified. Every ascender and terminal that can carry a 45° diagonal cut does — on the <b>v</b>, the crossbar of the <b>l</b>-stem, and the tail of the final <b>w</b>. This single repeated notch is the wordmark's private signature: a precision instrument's cut, not a decorative flourish. Tight negative space between letters reads as engineered, not loose or playful.</div>

    <div class="vc-grid vc-grid-2">
      <div class="vc-card">
        <svg width="320" height="90" viewBox="0 0 640 180">
          <text x="10" y="120" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="90" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-3" fill="#E9EDF0">velclaw</text>
          <path d="M10 55 L34 42 L34 57 Z" fill="#9FE3F0"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="vc-label">Primary wordmark — dark ground</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vc-card light">
